
================================================================
 CORTEX-M SECURITY POSTURE  (family: stm32f1)
================================================================
 (1) IDENTITY
   DBGMCU_IDCODE          DEV_ID=0x414 (STM32high-density)  REV_ID=0x2003
   Unique device ID       00000000-00000000-00000000
   Flash size             512 KB
 (2) READOUT PROTECTION
   RDPRT (FLASH_OBR bit 1) 0 -> not protected, flash readable (dev)
================================================================
 NOTE: reading any of the above proves the AHB-AP is OPEN -> internal flash is dumpable now.
================================================================
